{"level": "RD", "name": "The Road to Junk Town", "ppm": 165.0, "elev_deg": 47.0, "rooms": [{"id": "rd_apron", "r": [-1.0, 10.0, 3.0, 9.7], "name": "Silo 81 surface portal"}, {"id": "rd_road", "r": [-2.0, 64.0, -3.0, 3.0], "name": "The road east"}, {"id": "rd_reststop", "r": [36.0, 51.0, 3.0, 9.4], "name": "Rest stop"}, {"id": "rd_west", "r": [-2.0, 24.0, -12.0, 12.0], "name": "Snowfield"}, {"id": "rd_mid", "r": [24.0, 50.0, -12.0, 12.5], "name": "Snowfield"}, {"id": "rd_scrap", "r": [50.0, 64.0, -12.5, 12.5], "name": "Scrapyard"}, {"id": "jt_yard", "r": [64.0, 90.6, -12.6, 12.6], "name": "Junk Town"}], "walls": [], "doors": [], "props": [{"type": "silo_portal", "footprint": [0.0, 9.0, 9.9, 11.3], "sprite": "spr_000.png", "x0": -2200.4, "y0": -3050.2, "sort": [-711.7, -1288.5], "name": "Silo 81 surface portal", "text": "Six metres of poured concrete and two blast leaves, one jammed open. Someone scratched SEALED FROM INSIDE into the pier. The door is not sealed now."}, {"type": "guard_shack", "footprint": [11.5, 14.5, 7.8, 10.4], "sprite": "spr_001.png", "x0": 85.3, "y0": -2552.7, "sort": [455.0, -1885.8], "name": "Guard post", "text": "The heater is a block of rust. The duty log stops in the middle of a sentence. The chair is still pulled up to the window."}, {"type": "sandbag_nest", "footprint": [7.3, 10.7, 4.2, 7.4], "sprite": "spr_002.png", "x0": -52.3, "y0": -1664.4, "sort": [373.4, -1262.9], "name": "Sandbag nest", "text": "Empty. Brass casings frozen into the snow, all pointing outwards."}, {"type": "road_barrier", "footprint": [4.5, 4.5, 2.1, 2.1], "sprite": "spr_003.png", "x0": -55.0, "y0": -1055.8, "sort": [280.0, -563.2], "name": "Checkpoint barrier", "text": "The boom snapped where it met the post. A child's red mitten is tied to the stump."}, {"type": "notice_board", "footprint": [10.2, 12.2, 3.3, 3.6], "sprite": "spr_004.png", "x0": 761.7, "y0": -1581.9, "sort": [904.2, -1250.1], "name": "Evacuation notice", "text": "EVACUATION - NEW MERIDIAN - 40 KM. Assemble at the depot. Bring documents, warm clothing, three days of food. The arrow pointing east has been torn half away."}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [-0.8, -0.55, 4.5, 7.9], "sprite": "spr_005.png", "x0": -1023.7, "y0": -879.8, "sort": [-802.1, -471.4], "name": "Perimeter fence", "text": "Chain-link, bent outwards. Whatever went through it was leaving."}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [13.899, 17.301, 4.879, 5.6], "sprite": "spr_006.png", "x0": 961.7, "y0": -2208.0, "sort": [1208.8, -1778.2], "name": "Perimeter fence"}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [2.251, 7.349, -9.2, -5.319], "sprite": "spr_007.png", "x0": 857.4, "y0": -549.6, "sort": [1407.0, 209.9], "name": "Abandoned van", "text": "Nose in the snow, doors open. The seats have been cut out for the foam."}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [7.945, 12.455, -6.6, -3.837], "sprite": "spr_008.png", "x0": 1389.1, "y0": -938.2, "sort": [1798.9, -425.1], "name": "Abandoned car", "text": "A family estate car. Under the snow on the back seat, a shape you decide not to look at closely."}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [10.993, 15.807, -10.6, -5.835], "sprite": "spr_009.png", "x0": 2130.1, "y0": -1014.9, "sort": [2522.2, -442.2], "name": "Abandoned van"}, {"type": "glbp", "footprint": [-0.905, 2.105, -7.0, -2.449], "sprite": "spr_010.png", "x0": 214.7, "y0": -167.9, "sort": [621.2, 351.9], "name": "Abandoned car"}, {"type": "army_truck_side", "footprint": [16.2, 23.0, -10.8, -7.8], "sprite": "spr_011.png", "x0": 2756.8, "y0": -1623.9, "sort": [3371.8, -878.9], "name": "Army truck", "text": "On its side. Sandbags, a field radio, jerrycans. No bodies. No tracks leading away, either."}, {"type": "dead_tree", "footprint": [-1.4, -0.6, -11.5, -10.7], "sprite": "spr_012.png", "x0": 740.1, "y0": 74.6, "sort": [1178.4, 1032.5]}, {"type": "dead_tree", "footprint": [17.4, 18.2, 8.4, 9.2], "sprite": "spr_013.png", "x0": 827.4, "y0": -3133.9, "sort": [1050.1, -2269.8]}, {"type": "dead_tree", "footprint": [22.4, 23.2, 10.2, 11.0], 